Problems in Cyclic graph generation:
It's still hard to implement
Quality assurance
     What if generation is not correct
      What if players lock themselves out etc.
Player expectation 
      If generator gets good, they will approach the game         in a different way
Generated game may generate solutions not found In a hand designed game but that also means not solvable solutions can be generated because they were not accounted for
So many patterns to explore

Unreachable lever
Wrong generation can look like an unsolvable puzzle
No generator will be perfect 
Macguffin/Deus Ex Machina (Pray for help)
Small level generates more interesting stuff
Transformative not necessary generative


